# Only services/ goes into the API image (Dockerfile), and two lists of the
# app: nothing else is sent to Docker, above all no .env and no downloaded
# road graphs.
*
!services/route-engine/pyproject.toml
!services/route-engine/route_engine/
!services/ai/pyproject.toml
!services/ai/shaperoute_ai/
!services/api/pyproject.toml
!services/api/shaperoute_api/
# The SQL the API applies when it starts (TASK-114, TASK-122).
!services/api/migrations/
# The app's lists of lakes and beaches: the API keeps the Paddle shapes drawn
# from their points (water_spots.py, TASK-246 part B).
!apps/mobile/src/paddle/lakes.json
!apps/mobile/src/paddle/beaches.json
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
